<http://www.spektrix.com/persephonetheatre/event/67401ALTRTTRTPTSQHLNNDTGHMDRBCNBR>
  a schema:Event;
  schema:name " FEBBREAK27 | Comedy Countdown Show | Ages 11 to 14";
  schema:description """
	This is a four day, full day program. <span><br/></span><span><br/></span>Students should wear comfy clothing they can easily move in, have indoor shoes, and bring a water bottle, snacks and lunch (nut free please) <span><br/></span><span><br/></span>If you have program questions, please email Director of Education, Lorna Batycki lorna.b@persephonetheatre.org<span><br/></span>
""";
