<http://www.spektrix.com/persephonetheatre/event/18601AGJVHRJDDNTMMMDTKPLTNBGVTLHV>
  a schema:Event;
  schema:name "An Evening with Kim Coates - A One Night Only Event";
  schema:description """
	Join us for a one night only fundraising event for Persephone Theatre with Kim Coates. <span><br/></span><span><br/></span>This fundraising event will be held similar to \"Inside the Actor's Studio, with Mr. Coates in conversation with CTV's Jeff Rogstad and media personality Caitrin Hodson. <span><br/></span><span><br/></span>Kim Coates has been working nonstop since wrapping his role as the lovable bad boy ‘Tig’ on FX’s hit series SONS OF ANARCHY. Coates recently appeared in the Netflix limited series AMERICAN PRIMEVAL as the iconic \"Brigham Young\" opposite Taylor Kitsch; and received critical acclaim for his role as “Bruegel” in the AMC series DEAD CITY, a spinoff of the successful WALKING DEAD Universe.<span><br/></span><span><br/></span>VIP tickets include a preshow meet and greet hour with Kim Coates in the Tier 2 Lounge at 6:15 p.m. VIP guests will have the opportunity to chat with him, as well as enjoy a complimentary beverage. VIP tickets are limited. <span><br/></span><span><br/></span>ASL interpretation and seating available. Please call to reserve.
""";
  schema:startDate "2026-02-21T19:30:00"^^xsd:dateTime;
