<http://www.spektrix.com/persephonetheatre/event/5601AMGRKCNRPTGHLVLGRJSVLDNJMKSJC>
  a schema:Event;
  schema:name "Discovery Kids - Age 4 & 5 - Winter Session ";
  schema:description """
	Come play with us! Saturday mornings are so much fun with music and games designed to have your child discovering their creative side! Stories, actions, emotions, each one of our 12 weeks has a different theme aimed at helping your child find their voice. We will also have a session when our little performers can share what they’ve been working on.
""";
