<http://www.spektrix.com/persephonetheatre/event/3461AJBDCCSPNJPJTHKRQNDJCJPQJCVLP>
  a schema:Event;
  schema:name "Discovery Kids - Ages 4 & 5";
  schema:description """
	Come play with us! Saturday mornings are so much fun with music and games designed to have your child discovering their creative side! Stories, actions, emotions - each one of our 12 weeks has a different theme aimed at helping your child find their voice. We will also have two sessions where our little performers can share what they’ve been working on.
""";
