  schema:description """
	<h2><span class=\"BoldText\">September 12 - October 17, 2026</span></h2><span class=\"BoldText\">Saturdays | 12:15 PM - 1:15 PM</span><span><br/></span><span><br/></span>Students should wear comfy clothing they can easily move in, have indoor shoes, and can bring a water bottle. <span><br/></span><span><br/></span><span class=\"UnderlineText\">Session 1 Themes</span><span><br/></span>September 12: Blast Off to FUN!<span><br/></span>September 19: Dino Dance Party!<span><br/></span>September 26: Fantastic Fantasy! <span><br/></span>October 3: Fairy Tale Fun! <span><br/></span>October 10: Thankfully Creative! <span><br/></span>October 17: Musical Mayhem!**<span><br/></span>**<span class=\"ItalicText\">Parents will also be invited to come to the end portion of class.</span><span><br/></span><span><br/></span>If you have program questions, please email Director of Education, Lorna Batycki: lorna.b@persephonetheatre.org
""";
