<http://www.spektrix.com/persephonetheatre/event/56201AGSGSGJVVGPLSGRNJSLQQTTQHHRQ>
  a schema:Event;
  schema:name "FALL | Encore Adult | Ages 19+ | 12 WEEK";
  schema:description """
	<h2><span class=\"BoldText\">September 14- December 7, 2026</span></h2><span class=\"BoldText\">Mondays | 7:00 PM - 9:00 PM</span><span><br/></span><span><br/></span>Students should wear comfy clothing they can easily move in, have indoor shoes, and bring a water bottle. Please also have a folder or small binder for any handouts or scripts you receive, along with a pencil and highlighter.  <span><br/></span><span><br/></span>This registration link is for the full 12 week program and includes all three sessions. If you would prefer to register for individual sessions, please visit their dedicated registration pages.<span><br/></span><span><br/></span><span class=\"BoldText\">Session One: Improv | September 14 - October 5, 2026</span><span><br/></span>Work on impulse and risk taking to build confidence with our fun and inclusive improv sessions. Learn to trust yourself and take chances as you explore characters and ideas spontaneously and in collaboration with others.  <span><br/></span><span><br/></span><span class=\"BoldText\">Session Two: Auditions & Monologues | October 19 - November 9, 2026</span><span><br/></span>Whether it's for community theatre, professional auditions, or for school or program entry, auditioning is one of the most important tools an actor has. From making a first impression to confidence to redirection, during these four weeks we will work with you to build these skills whilst you polish a piece or prepare something new.<span><br/></span><span><br/></span><span class=\"BoldText\">Session Three: Scene Work | November 16 - December 7, 2026</span><span><br/></span>With a focus on text, character building, voice, and physicality, this is an opportunity for all skill levels to explore the dynamics of a scene and how to take words and create something meaningful. <span><br/></span><span><br/></span>If you have program questions, please email Director of Education, Lorna Batycki: lorna.b@persephonetheatre.org<span><br/></span><span><br/></span><span class=\"ItalicText\">Please note we are required to charge GST/PST for all students age 15 and up.</span><span><br/></span> <span><br/></span>
""";
