  a schema:Event;
  schema:name "FALL | Encore Adult | Session Three: Scene Work | Ages 19+";
  schema:description """
	<h2><span class=\"BoldText\">November 16- December 7, 2026</span></h2><span class=\"BoldText\">Mondays | 7:00 PM - 9:00 PM</span><span><br/></span><span><br/></span>Students should wear comfy clothing they can easily move in, have indoor shoes, and bring a water bottle. Please also have a folder or small binder for any handouts or scripts you receive, along with a pencil and highlighter.  <span><br/></span><span><br/></span>This registration link is only for Session Three of Encore Adult. If you would prefer to register for the full 12 week program that includes all sessions, please visit the dedicated registration page.<span><br/></span><span><br/></span><span class=\"BoldText\">Session Three: Scene Work | November 16 - December 7, 2026</span><span><br/></span>With a focus on text, character building, voice, and physicality, this is an opportunity for all skill levels to explore the dynamics of a scene and how to take words and create something meaningful.<span><br/></span><span><br/></span>If you have program questions, please email Director of Education, Lorna Batycki: lorna.b@persephonetheatre.org<span><br/></span><span><br/></span><span class=\"ItalicText\">Please note we are required to charge GST/PST for all students age 15 and up.</span>
""";
