<http://www.spektrix.com/persephonetheatre/event/55802AGDQTSCCLKGNMLKSHRLQGNVNDSDP>
  a schema:Event;
  schema:name "FALL | Encore Adult | Session Two: Auditions & Monologues | Ages 19+";
  schema:description """
	<h2><span class=\"BoldText\">October 19 - November 9, 2026</span></h2><span class=\"BoldText\">Mondays | 7:00 PM - 9:00 PM</span><span><br/></span><span><br/></span>Students should wear comfy clothing they can easily move in, have indoor shoes, and bring a water bottle. Please also have a folder or small binder for any handouts or scripts you receive, along with a pencil and highlighter.  <span><br/></span><span><br/></span>This registration link is only for Session Two of Encore Adult. If you would prefer to register for the full 12 week program that includes all sessions, please visit the dedicated registration page.<span><br/></span><span><br/></span><span class=\"BoldText\">Session Two: Auditions & Monologues | October 19 - November 9, 2026</span><span><br/></span>Whether it's for community theatre, professional auditions, or for school or program entry, auditioning is one of the most important tools an actor has. From making a first impression to confidence to redirection, during these four weeks we will work with you to build these skills whilst you polish a piece or prepare something new.<span><br/></span><span><br/></span>If you have program questions, please email Director of Education, Lorna Batycki: lorna.b@persephonetheatre.org<span><br/></span><span><br/></span><span class=\"ItalicText\">Please note we are required to charge GST/PST for all students age 15 and up.</span><span><br/></span> <span><br/></span>
""";
