<http://www.spektrix.com/persephonetheatre/event/3777ALMMQMQJGKDGVRPDJSNBKSVQLTMQC>
  a schema:Event;
  schema:name "FUNdamentals 2 - Ages 11 to 13";
  schema:description """
	Join us for our theatre skill-building program that focuses on acting through improvisation, scene work, and short scripts! Students will be challenged with a variety of activities, games, and scripted material with characters inspired by their ideas and interests. Family and friends can join us for our sharing at the end of the program.
""";
