<http://www.spektrix.com/persephonetheatre/event/34001AGQQHTLTHTMBJQGPRQRMLLBGHNMV>
  a schema:Event;
  schema:name "Oliver!";
  schema:description """
	Based Charles Dickens' classic tale, 'Oliver!' is a thrilling, heart-lifting musical packed with unforgettable songs, larger-than-life characters, and a story that balances grit with joy. As young Oliver navigates a world of hardship, temptation, and kindness, he reminds us that compassion can be found even in the darkest corners - and that belonging is worth fighting for.
""";
