  schema:description """
	<h1><span class=\"BoldText\"><span class=\"UnderlineText\">Special Relativity: The Electrodynamics of Moving Bodies</span></span></h1><span><br/></span>This production is recommended for audiences 12 years of age and older. Parental discretion is advised for younger patrons.<span><br/></span><span><br/></span>Please be advised that this performance may include:<span><br/></span><span><br/></span>Lighting effects that could affect individuals with light sensitivities or certain medical conditions.<span><br/></span>The use of theatrical fog'/'haze effects.<span><br/></span><span><br/></span>Performers:<span><br/></span><span><br/></span>Tatum Wildeman<span><br/></span>Tessa Leier<span><br/></span>Sarah Rutley<span><br/></span>Ilaria Zuzak<span><br/></span>Scott O’Byrne<span><br/></span>Ticket Policy<span><br/></span><span><br/></span>There are no exchanges, cancellations or refunds for tickets for any circumstances.<span><br/></span><span><br/></span>
""";
