<http://www.spektrix.com/persephonetheatre/event/34201ASMCSDCJKPKGCLJTKVRDGQJPPMJH>
  a schema:Event;
  schema:name "The Golden Anniversaries";
  schema:description """
	Since getting married, Glen and Sandy Golden have celebrated their wedding anniversary by spending a romantic weekend at the same cottage. Every year, for 50 years – well, almost. A week ago, Sandy called off their big 50th anniversary party and kicked Glen to the curb. Now, he wants to talk. Join the Goldens as they recount the good, the bad, and the ugly of spending half a century together. From the writer The Birds and the Bees, a recent Persephone audience favourite, The Golden Anniversaries is a comedy-drama about marriage, memory, and a long-term love for the ages.
""";
  schema:startDate "2026-10-21T19:30:00"^^xsd:dateTime;
