<http://www.spektrix.com/persephonetheatre/event/3210AQSGQGHBPTBSKQHHKBMLSKVJSHKHM>
  a schema:Event;
  schema:name "The Woman in Black";
  schema:description """
	by Stephen Mallatratt⁠<span><br/></span>adapted from the novel by Susan Hill⁠<span><br/></span><span><br/></span>Recommended Audience: 12 plus<span><br/></span>Running time: 2 hours, including intermission<span><br/></span><span><br/></span>Decades of obsession over a curse that he believes has been cast over him and his family by the spectre of a Woman in Black leads Arthur Kipps to engage a skeptical young actor to help him tell his terrifying story and finally exorcise the fear that grips his soul. But memory and reality begin to blur – are these lurking shadows a trick of the eye, or a haunting truth that will not be denied?<span><br/></span><span><br/></span>Set on the stage of an old Victorian theatre, <span class=\"ItalicText\">The Woman in Black</span> delivers atmosphere, illusion, and gothic horror to give you chills you won’t soon forget!
""";
